                <h1 class="text-base font-bold text-prompt m-0 uppercase">Headless Self-Hosted API &amp; Custom Frontend</h1>
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1 m-0">
                Transform Neogram into a headless photo publishing pipeline. Publish only JSON feeds and media to your Neocities site, and build your own custom display with Vanilla JavaScript.
              </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Concept Overview Box -->
            <div class="p-3 bg-black border border-main text-xs space-y-2">
              <div class="text-prompt font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-xxs">HEADLESS ARCHITECTURE &amp; ZERO-HTML PIPELINE</div>
              <p class="text-muted text-xs m-0 leading-relaxed">
                When you snap or upload a photo, Neogram automatically handles the heavy lifting: EXIF auto-rotation, 1200px WebP optimization, 400px thumbnail generation, and comments synchronization. In <strong>Headless Mode</strong>, Neogram suppresses HTML generation entirely—uploading strictly <code>feed.json</code>, <code>posts.json</code>, and your optimized media directly to your Neocities site.
              </p>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-xxs text-prompt pt-1 border-t border-main flex-wrap font-bold">
                <span>ZERO HTML GENERATED</span>
                <span>HOSTED ON YOUR OWN NEOCITIES DOMAIN</span>
