            <!-- How to Enable Opt-Out Setting -->
            <div class="retro-card p-4 m-0 flex flex-col gap-2">
              <h3 class="font-bold text-xs uppercase text-prompt m-0">1. Enabling Headless Mode in Settings</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-muted m-0 leading-relaxed">
                Headless mode is <strong>opt-out</strong> (enabled with full HTML generation by default). To switch to Headless API mode:
              </p>
              <ol class="text-xs text-muted m-0 pl-4 space-y-1">
                <li>Open <strong>Settings → Hosting &amp; Keys</strong> in Neogram.</li>
                <li>Under <strong>DEPLOYMENT INTEGRATION</strong>, find the <strong>Generate Static HTML Pages</strong> checkbox.</li>
                <li><strong>Uncheck</strong> the box.</li>
                <li>Click <strong>SAVE SETTINGS :&gt;</strong>.</li>
              </ol>
              <p class="text-xs text-prompt m-0 mt-1">
